## 1.1.0 — 02-09-2026

### Added
- new rule CAUSE_BLOCK_FALL has been added — it affects block categories subject to gravity (sand, gravel, anvils, dragon eggs, dripstone, etc.). If an attacker attempts to drop them onto a prohibited region, they will be destroyed without dropping any items.

### Bugfix
- Fixed the bug, that allowed players to install scaffolding in the region territory, who have the BUILD rule disabled.

- Other technical improvements related to the tracking system.



## 1.1.1 — 02-09-2026

### Bugfix
- Fixed the bug, when a fire charge released using a dispenser could bypass the region’s rule restrictions.

- Vulnerability has been fixed, in scenario, then player could activate a redstone machanism and leave the server, after which the actions performed by this redstone mechanism would bypass the existing regional restrictions.



## 1.1.2 — 04-09-2026

### Changed
- Adjusted the color tones used for the region HUD and grid.